WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.335
Remember when we thought
the pandemic was over?

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:03.878
We did it!

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:07.048
The pandemic is like a TV show
you thought was canceled,

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:09.342
and then it got picked up by Netflix.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.596
If a man calls another man crazy,
it's a compliment.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.974
But if I was like,
"This is my wife Jeannie, she's crazy."

00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:19.144
I even get nervous saying that.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.106
My wife was like, "I wanna go to Hawaii,

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.566
and I wanna bring the kids."

00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:26.526
And I was like, "Whose kids?"

00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:28.945
My one goal was to just not burn.

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:31.573
'Cause you see a kid with a sunburn,
you're like, "Parenting's hard."

00:00:31.656 --> 00:00:34.451
You see an adult with a sunburn,
you're like, "That's an alcoholic."

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:38.329
I almost feel sorry
for the accountants of the billionaires.

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:40.123
'Cause you know they were like,
"You had an amazing year.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.916
You made 40 billion dollars.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.419
But I fudged the numbers
so it looks like you broke even.

00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:48.089
As long as you lay low
and don't draw attention,

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:49.257
we should be fine.

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:52.385
You got anything coming up?"

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:54.345
"I built a rocket...

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:58.433
to fly to outer space.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:05.398
Does it matter if the rocket's
shaped like a penis?"

